]|[Mm][Dd]|[Mm][Kk][Dd][Ii][Rr]|[Mm][Kk][Ll][Ii][Nn][Kk]|[Mm][Oo][Vv][Ee]|[Pp][Aa][Tt][Hh]|[Pp][Aa][Uu][Ss][Ee]|[Pp][Oo][Pp][Dd]|[Pp][Rr][Oo][Mm][Pp][Tt]|[Pp][Uu][Ss][Hh][Dd]|[Rr][Dd]|[Rr][Ee][Nn]|[Rr][Ee][Nn][Aa][Mm][Ee]|[Rr][Mm][Dd][Ii][Rr]|[Ss][Ee][Tt][Ll][Oo][Cc][Aa][Ll]|[Ss][Hh][Ii][Ff][Tt]|[Ss][Tt][Aa][Rr][Tt]|[Tt][Ii][Mm][Ee]|[Tt][Ii][Tt][Ll][Ee]|[Tt][Yy][Pp][Ee]|[Vv][Ee][Rr]|[Vv][Ee][Rr][Ii][Ff][Yy]|[Vv][Oo][Ll])$\"))\n\n; `echo.`, `echo:` and `echo(` print their text.\n((command_name) @function.builtin\n  (#match? @function.builtin \"^[Ee][Cc][Hh][Oo][.:(/\\\\\\\\,;=+\\\\[\\\\]]\"))\n\n; `goto label`, `call :label`\n(command\n  name: (command_name) @function.builtin\n  .\n  argument: (word) @label\n  (#match? @function.builtin \"^([Gg][Oo][Tt][Oo]|[Cc][Aa][Ll][Ll])$\"))\n\n; Options passed to a command: /b, -x, --flag\n(command\n  argument: (word) @variable.parameter\n  (#match? @variable.parameter \"^(/|-)\"))\n\n; Literals\n; --------\n\n[\n  (string)\n  (value)\n] @string\n\n(command_string) @string.special\n\n(escape_sequence) @string.escape\n\n; Variables\n; ---------\n\n(variable_name) @variable\n\n[\n  (variable)\n  (delayed_variable)\n] @variable\n\n[\n  (parameter)\n  (for_variable)\n] @variable.parameter\n\n; Operators\n; ---------\n\n[\n  \"&\"\n  \"&&\"\n  \"||\"\n  \"|\"\n  \">\"\n  \">>\"\n  \"<\"\n  \">&\"\n  \"<&\"\n  \"==\"\n  \"equ\"\n  \"neq\"\n  \"lss\"\n  \"leq\"\n  \"gtr\"\n  \"geq\"\n  \"=\"\n] @operator\n\n; Punctuation\n; -----------\n\n[\n  \"(\"\n  \")\"\n] @punctuation.bracket\n\n[\n  \",\"\n  \";\"\n] @punctuation.delimiter\n","tags":"; Labels are the subroutines and jump targets of a script; `call :label` and\n; `goto label` refer to them.\n\n(label) @name @definition.function\n\n(command\n  name: (command_name) @_name\n  .\n  argument: (word) @name\n  (#match? @_name \"^([Gg][Oo][Tt][Oo]|[Cc][Aa][Ll][Ll])$\")\n  (#match? @name \"^:?[^:]\")) @reference.call\n","folds":"[\n  (block)\n  (for_statement)\n  (if_statement)\n] @fold\